# Dijital Asistan environment template — KEY NAMES ONLY. Never commit real values (.env is git-ignored).
# Tags: client-safe = may ship in app/web bundles; SERVER-ONLY = Edge Functions / server runtimes only;
#       build-time = CI/EAS/Vercel tooling. Missing credentials never block development: adapters report
#       'Harici kimlik bilgisi gerekli' and demo mode (DEMO_MODE=true, never in production) supplies fixtures.
# Local secrets (encryption keys, peppers, webhook secrets) are generated by: bash scripts/dev/env.sh --init

